      "created_at": "2013-08-27T03:03:05.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I'm going to guess that \"take into hand\" is to \"draw\" as \"put into play\" is to \"play\", meaning that they are not the same thing. &nbsp;But I've never seen a discussion of this, much less an official ruling, here on the forums.</p>",
