      "id": 71498,
      "name": "phantaskippy",
      "username": "phantaskippy",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/{size}/1897_2.png",
      "created_at": "2013-08-27T04:46:16.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>It is different, you cannot draw cards from your trash, and it selects a card.</p><p>Similarly Mr. Fixer's salvage yard allows Bunker to put all equips in his trash back in his hand even if Turret mode is out.</p><p>Omnitron's Timeshift works even if you can't draw or play cards (like Turret Bunker).</p><p>So yeah, legit, and from the sound of it, awesome win.</p><p>Interestingly Rook City Wraith's power says to reveal and then discard or play the card, which would not count as drawing but would count as playing the card.</p>",
      "post_number": 6,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:50:40.685Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
